Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "UnusualAnimalObstructionScenario" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1, :obstacle2, :obstacle3 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Large gorilla-like statue obstructing road" .
:obstacle2 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Smaller gorilla-like statue obstructing road" .
:obstacle3 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Large elephant-like statue obstructing road" .

:weather1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential collision with unexpected stationary large animal-like objects on road" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Occlusion of road by large stationary objects, reducing visibility of further road conditions" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :DistractionRisk ;
    :description "Unusual stationary objects may distract driver" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.85"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.70"^^xsd:float .
```

